    {
        "content": "<p>oh I see, I guess that's it, since the definition of <code>Ordinal.cof_iSup_le</code> is now <code>by_contra!</code> using <code>Ordinal.iSup_lt_of_lt_cof</code>... still seems a bit confusing and I'm not sure why it needed to be deprecated</p>",
        "id": 611753746,
