    {
        "content": "<p>I don't think we have this, but maybe <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Ordinal.enum#doc\">docs#Ordinal.enum</a> helps; is that what you've used to prove it? Or <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=InitialSeg.total#doc\">docs#InitialSeg.total</a> perhaps? (or <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/39907\">#39907</a>)<br>\nAlso reminds me of <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/39545\">#39545</a></p>",
